counterfactuals.output:
1. A data processing system comprising:

a host computing device comprising a processor and a memory, the memory storing a software entity having an associated receive queue;

a network interface controller coupled to the host computing device and configured to transfer packet data to the receive queue of the software entity; and

an accelerator module coupled between the network interface controller and a network, the accelerator module being configured to:

receive, from the network, an incoming packet stream addressed to one or more endpoints associated with the software entity;

determine that at least a portion of the incoming packet stream is to be processed by the accelerator module on behalf of the software entity;

perform packet processing on the at least a portion of the incoming packet stream to generate processed packet data for the one or more endpoints;

encapsulate the processed packet data in one or more packets formatted for delivery through the network interface controller; and

transmit the one or more encapsulating packets to the network interface controller,

wherein the network interface controller is configured to deliver the processed packet data, based on the one or more encapsulating packets, to the receive queue associated with the software entity.
